        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngoba iNkosi ithi: Njengoba ngehlisele phezu kwalababantu bonke lobububi, ngokunjalo ngizabehlisela konke okuhle engikukhulumileyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amasimu azathengwa kulelilizwe elilibiza ngokuthi: Liyinkangala engelamuntu lenyamazana, futhi linikelwe ezandleni zamaKaladiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amasimu azathengwa ngemali, kulungiswe incwadi zokuthenga, kulotshwe kuzo amabizo abofakazi, zinamatheliswe, elizweni lakoBenjamini lasemaphandleni aseJerusalema, lasemizini yakoJuda, lasemizini yasemaqaqeni, lasemizini yaseShefela, lasemizini yaseNegebi; ngoba ngizabuyisa abantu bakhona, kutsho iNkosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
